## Logistics Data Analysis
## Project Overview

This project focuses on strategic planning and data exploration in logistics. It aims to improve supply chain efficiency, optimize transportation routes, and support data-driven decision-making.

## Objectives
- Identify key logistics performance indicators (KPIs).
- Analyze delivery performance and transportation costs.
- Explore route optimization and inventory management.
- Propose a Python-based data analysis workflow.
## Key Performance Indicators
- On-time delivery rate
- Average delivery time
- Transportation cost per shipment
- Order fulfillment rate
- Inventory turnover
## Proposed Tools
- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Matplotlib
- Scikit-learn
## Analysis Roadmap
1. Collect logistics shipment data.
2. Clean and preprocess the dataset.
3. Perform exploratory data analysis.
4. Calculate logistics KPIs.
5. Explore delivery-time prediction and route optimization.
6. Present findings and recommendations.
## Expected Outcome

The project demonstrates how data analytics can help reduce logistics costs, improve delivery performance, and support operational planning.

Note: This repository currently contains the project plan. Actual analysis and results will be added as the project develops.
